<title>POLAND: VISCOPLAST TURNS TO LOSS IN JULY.</title>
<headline>VISCOPLAST TURNS TO LOSS IN JULY.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		 0.57 vs   0.23 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.57 vs   0.22</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.82 vs   0.20</p>
<p> Sales		    3.08 vs   3.72</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		 1.80 vs   1.12 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   1.80 vs   1.68 profit</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.10 vs   1.90</p>
<p> Sales		   29.75 vs  25.92</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish chemical firm is Viscoplast SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
